From: Sr-0w <Sr-0w@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: hotdog: integrate the hardware-validated runtime fixes

Carry the complete net kernel delta used by the validated 2026-08-25 image,
rather than only the final UFS ICE change. This keeps the next package-built
image aligned with the running hardware checkpoint:

- touch, camera actuator, Wi-Fi, modem and IPA suspend/recovery fixes;
- the generic three-position alert-slider input contract;
- the QDSP6 hostless and Elliptic ultrasonic proximity path;
- UFS inline crypto and PM8150/IMEM bootloader and recovery modes.

Experimental changes that were reverted before the hardware checkpoint are
absent from this net patch. UFS ICE, bootloader selection, recovery selection,
alert-slider states, sensor userspace and ultrasonic proximity were all tested
on the HD1913. Current rootfs encryption and proximity blanking during a real
call are not claimed.

Signed-off-by: Sr-0w <Sr-0w@users.noreply.github.com>
---
